        <dl>${TERMS.slice().sort((a, b) => a[0].localeCompare(b[0])).map((t) => `<dt>${t[0]}</dt><dd>${esc(t[2])}</dd>`).join('')}</dl>
        <h3>Playing as a class</h3>
        <p>Choose "As a class, on one screen" when you take your seat. The page gives you role cards to print, a clock for each speech and a set of questions to talk over at the end. The votes are a real show of hands, counted in your room and typed in by the teacher or youth worker. If the votes are equal, your Chairman settles it with the casting vote.</p>
